d91957d09bd34f144b31407cb09f58fcf1a61dfd:
### How do I check whether my emails land in the inbox or spam? {slug: cold-email-agent/faq/deliverability/how-do-i-check-whether-my-emails-land-in-the-inbox-or-spam}
Get here: In the left sidebar, click "Deliverability"
A placement test runs weekly. The "Results" tab shows inbox, tab, spam or never arrived: 80% or more inbox is Good; 65% to under 80% Needs a look; under 65% Poor, fix before sending more. "Inboxes to watch" shows the worst inboxes; "Latest test by provider" splits Google and Microsoft. Click "Run a test" for an immediate test; emails arrive within hours. A single self-sent email tests only one email from one inbox.

